# AWS SNS Topic Provisioning with Terraform

## Overview
Automates the creation of an Amazon Simple Notification Service (SNS) topic for the **Nautilus DevOps** team using Infrastructure as Code (IaC).

---

## Configuration (`main.tf`)
```hcl
resource "aws_sns_topic" "nautilus_notifications" {
  name = "nautilus-notifications"
}
Deployment Steps
Initialize Terraform:

Bash
terraform init
Apply Infrastructure:

Bash
terraform apply -auto-approve
Deployment Results
Status: Apply complete! Resources: 1 added, 0 changed, 0 destroyed.

Topic Name: nautilus-notifications

Topic ARN: arn:aws:sns:us-east-1:000000000000:nautilus-notifications


